    "Versatile Treatment: Unlike Moth Balls or Moth Traps our Carpet Moth Treatment can be used as a surface or space spray, protecting a large area with minimal effort, making it an incredibly effective treatment for use around the home.",
    "Easy to Use: Simply treat the impacted area with our Moth Killer & follow up with the repellent to double-down on the Moth-stopping power. For best results ensure any impacted clothes/textiles are washed at the highest temperature permissible to ensure any eggs are totally destroyed."
